ure.com/articles/s41562-026-02434-3&amp;signal=2&amp;source=Nature%20Human%20Behaviour&amp;type=rss&amp;context=pretty_positive%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Global%20Analysis%3A%20Nature%20Contact%20Reduces%20Anxiety%20and%20Depression&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;💪 Pretty Positive. Kinda Cool.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.nature.com/articles/s41562-026-02434-3&amp;signal=1&amp;source=Nature%20Human%20Behaviour&amp;type=rss&amp;context=neutral_okay%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Global%20Analysis%3A%20Nature%20Contact%20Reduces%20Anxiety%20and%20Depression&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🤔 Hmm. Okay, but forgettable.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.nature.com/articles/s41562-026-02434-3&amp;signal=0&amp;source=Nature%20Human%20Behaviour&amp;type=rss&amp;context=not_interested%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Global%20Analysis%3A%20Nature%20Contact%20Reduces%20Anxiety%20and%20Depression&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥱 Don't Care... Not Interested&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.nature.com/articles/s41562-026-02434-3&amp;signal=-1&amp;source=Nature%20Human%20Behaviour&amp;type=rss&amp;context=too_gloomy%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Global%20Analysis%3A%20Nature%20Contact%20Reduces%20Anxiety%20and%20Depression&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Nega